{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲核子研究中心（CERN）正在為大型強子對撞機（LHC）的下一輪升級研製新一代超導磁體。這些採用新材料和製造工藝的磁體，已經在測試中達到11.3特斯拉的磁場強度，將成為未來高亮度大型強子對撞機的重要組成部分。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585936.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:16:24.582608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.631078+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.631078+00:00","content_hash":"950aacf73d838c9f59c9df6ddd85ab40afc4604e9a7c703ee28441cb4c15a8c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}